<title>SINGAPORE: Avimo requests share suspension.</title>
<headline>Avimo requests share suspension.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avimo Group Ltd said in a statement on Wednesday it had asked the Stock Exchange of Singapore to suspend trading of its shares on May 15, pending an announcement.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
